   "id": 666389,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Given <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">x = 8</code> and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">y = 21</code>, what is the final value of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">z</code>?\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if (x &lt; 10) and (y &gt; 20):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;z = 5\nelse:\n&nbsp;&nbsp;z = 0\n</pre>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328229,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">0</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "(8 &lt; 10) and (21 > 20) evaluates to True and True, which is True. So the body of the if is executed, and z is assigned with 5."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328230,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">5</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">(8 &lt; 10) and (21 &gt; 20)</code> evaluates to <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">True and True</code>, which is <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">True</code>. So the body of the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if</code> is executed, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">z</code> is assigned with <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">5</code>."
    }
   ],
